  "body": "• Lot 1: approx. 160m² floor area on 156m² of land\r\n\r\n• Lot 2: approx. 160m² floor area on 143m² of land\r\n\r\n• Lot 3: approx. 160.8m² floor area on 157m² of land\r\n\r\n• Lot 4: approx. 186.7m² floor area on 169m² of land\r\n\r\n• Lot 5: approx. 214m² floor area on 136m² of land\r\n\r\n• Lot 6: approx. 214m² floor area on 164m² of land\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for total peace of mind\r\n\r\n• Brand-new, solid, and modern two-level homes on freehold titles, featuring quality interiors and stylish finishes throughout\r\n\r\n• Four double bedrooms plus a study, two family bathrooms, and a separate W/C, including a master ensuite\r\n\r\n• Spacious living areas with an open-plan modern kitchen\r\n\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to an entertainer’s deck—perfect for relaxed outdoor living\r\n\r\n• Single internal-access garage plus off-street parking",
